        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>You offer reassuring guidance alongside physical assistance, making your allies confident of your approval.</em></p><p>After you use the @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.K2QgKOSezyeYnnxl]{Aid} reaction on an ally, spend 1 focus to grant that ally the benefits of your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence} (no action required).</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>When you @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.K2QgKOSezyeYnnxl]{Aid} a character, spend 1 focus to grant them @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence}.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>After you use the @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.K2QgKOSezyeYnnxl]{Aid} reaction on an ally, spend 1 focus to grant that ally the benefits of your @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.heroic-paths.Item.l4wRQT2MH0SsxmRQ]{Rousing Presence} (no action required).</p>"
